          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "If, when the game ends, the number of eggs on the field is at least total players*3/8-1 (min 4), the Cuckoo wins. (Regardless of whether the Cuckoo lives; priority above Arsonist and Nian Beast, below other independent Neutrals.)",
